{"chars": "They walked slowly between the trees, side by side. Finding an orchid is not like finding a red ball in the snow. You have to go slowly. You have to look carefully, low down, in all the little hollows and shadows. Mrs. Claus knelt every few steps, gently parting the moss with her fingers. Santa peered behind fallen logs. They passed low bushes of wild blueberries, which were just beginning to flower, covered in tiny pink-and-white bells.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.9, 1.988, 1.988, 1.988, 1.988, 1.988, 2.325, 2.325, 2.325, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 3.2, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.712, 3.712, 3.712, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 4.175, 4.175, 4.175, 4.3, 4.3, 4.3, 4.3, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 4.675, 5.075, 5.075, 5.15, 5.15, 5.15, 5.15, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.375, 5.662, 5.662, 5.662, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 6.475, 6.575, 6.575, 6.575, 6.575, 6.713, 6.713, 6.713, 6.713, 6.713, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.875, 7.975, 7.975, 7.975, 7.975, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 8.562, 9.2, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.525, 9.525, 9.525, 9.525, 9.525, 9.875, 9.925, 9.925, 9.925, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 10.625, 11.062, 11.062, 11.062, 11.062, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 12.1, 12.2, 12.2, 12.2, 12.2, 12.2, 12.525, 12.525, 12.525, 12.525, 12.525, 12.525, 12.85, 1